Note on the pet: the visual content shipped in `lib/client.js` is a small
whale drawn with inline SVG and CSS. It is an original drawing of this project,
it is not a DeepSeek asset, and it is not official branding. This package
contains no third-party video, image, font or audio assets, and fetches nothing
at runtime. The pet carries no licence obligations beyond the terms above.
